{"author": "pgaudet", "body": "Dear all, \r\n\r\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete \r\nGO:0019048 modulation by virus of host process and \r\nGO:0019054 modulation by virus of host cellular process\r\n\r\nSee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/26621\r\n\r\nAnnotations are here: \r\nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Gj7-EkhPzFB9YaFDKjbNPVWVwTNC6ysazKzhHiIgRQI/edit?gid=0#gid=0\r\n\r\n4 UniProt - done\r\n2 CACAO\r\n8 InterPro annotation\r\n1 UniRule\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks, Pascale\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n", "created_at": "2024-11-18T12:53:20Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to GO:0019048 modulation by virus of host process and GO:0019054 modulation by virus of host cellular process", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2024-11-22T15:56:31Z"}
